//   sampled token, or we append exactly one token to generated and increment
//   steps by 1; OpenConstrainedSpan also appends exactly the opening delimiter
//   token and we increment steps by 1. In the close branch, CloseConstrainedSpan
//   appends exactly one token and we increment steps by 1. In the inside append
//   branch, AppendConstrainedToken appends exactly one token after a single
//   ConstrainedStep, and we increment steps by 1. Break branches stop
//   immediately, so the linear bound |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is
//   preserved in all cases.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END
